rdbuf</code></a> with the pointer to the newly-constructed underlying <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf\"><span class=\"kw2666\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_syncbuf</span></span></a></span></code> to complete the initialization of the base. After this move constructor, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other.<span class=\"me1\">get_wrapped</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">nullptr</span></code> and destruction of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> produces no output.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> buf\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\">std::basic_streambuf</a></span> that will be wrapped\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> os\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> reference to a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span>, whose rdbuf() will be wrapped\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> a\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the allocator to pass to the constructor of the member <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_syncbuf</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another osyncstream to move from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;syncstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;thread&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> worker<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> id, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1746\">std::<s